    {
      "text": "MODULE INTERNAL CIRCUIT",
      "page_pdf": 17,
      "page_manual": "EVB-17",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.44,
        512.04826718,
        211.16572250399997,
        501.9015616630055
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "A module consists of two parallel-connected cells placed in series. The Li-ion battery has 48 modules placed in series in total. Ninety-six parallel-connected cell pairs are connected in series.",
      "page_pdf": 17,
      "page_manual": "EVB-17",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        498.4759,
        369.6103539999997,
        466.2529328640884
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 17,
      "page_manual": "EVB-17",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        463.9771288,
        86.03907400000001,
        454.7335412640884
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cell voltage displayed on the data monitor of CONSULT means the potential  difference  between  the  upstream  and  the  downstream of the parallel circuit.",
      "page_pdf": 17,
      "page_manual": "EVB-17",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        452.4577372,
        369.6331132000001,
        420.23477006408837
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 17,
      "page_manual": "EVB-17",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        139.37590999999998,
        86.03907400000001,
        130.13232246408836
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The highest potential is module (MD) 1 and the lowest is module (MD) 48.",
      "page_pdf": 17,
      "page_manual": "EVB-17",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        127.91592200000002,
        394.9375851999994,
        118.67233446408841
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "CELL",
      "page_pdf": 17,
      "page_manual": "EVB-17",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.44,
        100.44828717999997,
        81.15649305800001,
        90.30158166300555
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "These are thin laminated cells with excellent cooling performance.",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        735.83589,
        357.6311040000003,
        726.5923024640884
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Features of Laminated Cell",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        598.3912771800001,
        192.03531245700003,
        589.5726733204641
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Large surface area with excellent cooling performance reduces heat load to the battery and improves battery life.",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        586.43592,
        558.5165399999995,
        565.6729408640886
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Light and thin structure increases flexibility in layout.",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.139999999999986,
        563.3959884000001,
        304.93416000000036,
        554.1524008640886
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heater Relay Unit",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        536.08998,
        158.35900800000002,
        524.1901891491713
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The heater relay unit is installed in the battery pack (under the service plug).",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        511.43592,
        368.3759519999997,
        490.6729408640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "When receiving a relay control signal from LBC (Li-ion battery controller),  the  heater  relay  unit  turns  ON  the  built-in  relay  and  supplies high-voltage power to each Li-ion battery heater.",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        488.4565404,
        368.29013519999944,
        456.17416966408837
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Li-ion Battery Heater",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        374.20992,
        175.54876800000002,
        362.31012914917125
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Li-ion battery heater is installed in the battery pack.",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        349.55592,
        296.54071319999986,
        340.3123324640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "High voltage power is supplied from the heater relay unit.",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        338.0365284,
        324.4431791999999,
        328.7929408640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Each Li-ion battery heater is connected in parallel.",
      "page_pdf": 18,
      "page_manual": "EVB-18",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        326.5765404,
        292.5671447999998,
        317.3329528640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
