    },
    {
      "text": "The battery current sensor is installed to bus bar between battery junction box and rear module stack.",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        573.95588,
        369.60262839999956,
        553.1917524640885
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "This sensor measures charge/discharge current sent to Li-ion battery  and  transmits  a  current  signal  to  Li-ion  battery  controller (LBC).",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        550.9159484,
        369.5844627999993,
        518.6929812640886
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Li-ion  Battery  controller  (LBC)  measures  remaining  battery  level according to charge/discharge current and sends the data to VCM.",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46000999999998,
        516.4171772000002,
        369.53623000000033,
        495.71360166408857
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Battery Temperature Sensor",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.44,
        437.6899,
        220.738368,
        425.79010914917126
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "  Three battery temperature sensors mounted in the battery pack measure the temperature.",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        413.09593,
        369.6208983999996,
        392.3318024640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The installation position of the sensors are;",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        390.0559984,
        263.68298200000027,
        380.8124108640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "-Front module stack RH: Two for front and rear",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        378.5960104,
        274.72015000000033,
        369.3524228640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rear module stack: One",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        367.07547040000003,
        174.66005800000002,
        357.8318828640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The sensor uses a thermistor with a resistance value that varies according to changes in temperature. The electrical resistance of the thermistor decreases as the temperature increases.",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        265.6759264,
        369.6082660000004,
        233.39355566408835
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "EVB",
      "page_pdf": 19,
      "page_manual": "EVB-19",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        568.37988,
        643.6912671800001,
        588.3435248437999,
        634.8726633204641
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Battery Junction Box",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.139942400000024,
        736.009334,
        175.59037440000006,
        724.1095431491713
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The battery junction box is installed to the front side in the battery pack.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        711.35591,
        368.27364000000046,
        690.5929308640885
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The battery junction box includes:",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        688.3765304000001,
        219.50364000000025,
        679.1329428640886
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "-System main relay to provide/interrupt DC current sent from Li-ion battery.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        676.8559904000001,
        368.2976519999995,
        656.0930112640887
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "-Pre-charge relay to protect the high voltage circuit from a high current immediately after power switch ON.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        653.8766108000002,
        368.30704800000035,
        633.1136316640888
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Installed to both positive side and negative side, the system main relay provides DC current to each high voltage part. In addition, the system main relay provides DC current to the Li-ion battery during motor regeneration or charge.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        630.8366792000003,
        368.3289719999997,
        587.0920236640889
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "When  an  error  occurs  in  the  system,  the  system  main  relay  is turned OFF and the Li-ion battery is interrupted for ensuring safety, based on a command from VCM (Vehicle control module). JSCIA0276ZZ",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.140000000000015,
        586.83565,
        558.5340791999998,
        552.593252464089
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Service Plug",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        534.52992,
        127.67293439999996,
        522.6301291491712
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The service plug is included in the Li-ion battery to securely disconnect the high voltage during high voltage part inspection and maintenance.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        509.87586,
        368.29566839999967,
        477.65289286408836
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The service plug is installed on the upper surface of the battery pack. The plug can be removed when the leg-room mounted service plug cover is removed.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        475.37708879999997,
        368.33001599999955,
        443.15412166408834
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Always  use  insulating  protective  equipment  when  removing  and installing service plug.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        440.87831759999995,
        368.30287200000043,
        420.1153384640883
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "High Voltage Warning Label",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        373.66991,
        218.22345600000003,
        361.77011914917125
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "High voltage warning label is affixed to each of the following component parts.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        349.01591,
        412.1550479999997,
        339.7723224640884
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "After replacing a part, check that the part is affixed with a label. If the label is not affixed, be sure to affix the label in the original position.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        52.139999999999986,
        337.4965184,
        558.5437883999992,
        316.7929428640884
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Li-ion Battery",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        308.58827718,
        119.71154236289996,
        298.4415716630055
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "The label is affixed to the rear end of Li-ion battery.",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        295.016,
        295.8670200000001,
        285.7724124640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": ": Vehicle front",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        83.16,
        141.55428717999996,
        134.48400426660007,
        134.06378497792264
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": ": Direction of the label INFOID:0000000008745913",
      "page_pdf": 20,
      "page_manual": "EVB-20",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        244.75253600750005,
        141.55428717999996,
        326.65279301620023,
        134.06378497792264
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    }
  ],
